  {"id": "s21", "at": 36.0, "kind": "move", "refs": ["pearl"], "key": "Close-up in a warm gold-lit room: the fluffy white Persian cat with a pink collar with a gold heart sits on a pink velvet cushion in the classic cat grooming pose: one hind leg stretched straight up in the air above her head, her head bent down between her legs, her pink tongue out, licking herself.", "seed": 9, "move": "she licks her backside with her hind leg in the air"},
  {"id": "s22", "at": 38.65, "kind": "hold", "refs": ["phantom"], "key": "Night, close-up: the slim ginger tabby cartoon cat with a big round head, in a black t-shirt, on a dark windowsill, the dreamy look fading from his face, sobering up, half-closed green eyes, warm gold light on his face.", "move": "his dreamy look fades and he blinks, his mouth stays closed"},
  {"id": "s23", "at": 40.95, "kind": "hold", "refs": ["phantom"], "key": "Extreme close-up of the face of the slim ginger tabby cartoon cat with a big round head at night: flat, disappointed, deadpan half-closed green eyes looking into the camera, gold light on one side of his face, mouth closed.", "move": "he stares flatly into the camera and his ears droop, his mouth stays closed"},
  {"id": "s24", "at": 42.9, "kind": "move", "refs": ["sarah"], "key": "Sunny morning, a wide shot of two back yards split down the middle by a chest-high wooden fence that runs from the bottom of the frame to the back. LEFT of the fence: the shabby back yard of an old house, dead brown patchy grass, a cracked porch, and the tired woman with a messy brown bun and dark circles under her eyes, in light blue nurse scrubs, standing on the porch holding a coffee mug. RIGHT of the fence: the neighbor's perfect yard, a bright green lawn with sprinklers spraying, colorful flower beds and a blue swimming pool. The pool is only on the neighbor's side, right of the fence.", "move": "the sprinklers spray on the neighbor's lawn, the woman on the porch sips her coffee", "seed": 8},
  {"id": "s25", "at": 44.51, "kind": "talk", "who": "lisa", "refs": ["lisa"], "key": "Sunny morning in a beautiful garden full of flowers: the pretty woman with long wavy brown hair in a yellow sundress stands in her flower bed by a chest-high wooden fence, a little bluebird on her finger, a white rabbit at her feet, waving happily with a big sweet smile.", "move": "she waves happily and calls out a cheerful greeting"},
